    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1021">

                <pb facs="1101" n="1089" sameAs="frus:frus1945v04/pg1089"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 EW/11–2845: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in the Soviet
                        Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harriman</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-11-28T17:00:00-05:00">November 28,
                            1945—5 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2409. Deptel 2359 Nov. 17.<anchor n="19" xml:id="d1021-f1"/> In connection with
                    revision of Ital armistice regime pls inform FonOff that, on basis of Potsdam
                    agreement re French participation in Ital peace treaty,<anchor n="20"
                        xml:id="d1021-f2"/> we are of opinion France should be regarded as
                    “signatory power” for armistice revision and inquire whether Soviet Govt concurs
                    in this view.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1021-f1" n="19" xml:id="d1021-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; it was similar to telegram 2123, November 17, to Rome, <ref
                        target="#pg1087">p. 1087</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1021-f2" n="20" xml:id="d1021-f2-content">
                <p>See Protocol of the Proceedings of the Berlin Conference, section I, (3) (ii),
                        <ref target="frus1945Berlinv02#pg_1478">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Conference of Berlin</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Potsdam</hi>), vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, pp.
                    1478</ref>, <ref target="frus1945Berlinv02#pg_1479">1479</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
